### Page content

- **Purpose** — PDCA framing aligned with the AI prompt; holistic polish on `landing_page` / `product_page` / `forge-card` surfaces; complements `DET.SURFACE.ELEVATION_TOKEN`, `DET.TOKEN.NO_DRIFT`, `DET.LAYOUT.GRID_CONSISTENCY`.
- **Passing signals** — Calm hero rhythm, consistent card language, Forge typography scale, purposeful imagery, restrained accents.
- **Failing signals** — Template soup, cramped fold, typography drift, competing accents, decorative filler, hype stacking, broken grid rhythm.
- **Before example** — Failing HTML: cramped `landing-hero`, inline styles, mixed `forge-card` / `glass` / Bootstrap `card`, four competing CTAs.
- **After example** — Passing HTML: `fs-landing-hero-band`, `landing-hero-kicker`, `product-landing-title`, `forge-card card-amber breathe-link`, `fs-marketing-stat-band` with `forge-stat--amber` / `forge-stat--cyan`, hash markers.
- **Evidence and remediation** — Screenshot/DOM capture checklist plus seven ordered remediation steps with `DET.*` promotion guidance.
- **Related rules** — Eight linked rules in body and front matter.

